{"seq":3,"slug":"autoencoder-embeddings","title":"自编码器嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/manifold-learning/autoencoder-embeddings","wordCount":1510,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自编码器嵌入\">自编码器嵌入</h1><p><a href=\"tsne\">t-SNE</a> 和 <a href=\"umap\">UMAP</a> 都靠手工设计的邻域规则去展开流形。自编码器走一条完全不同的路：把降维交给神经网络，让它自己学出一个非线性映射。它的构造朴素得近乎狡黠——让网络把输入压缩再还原，逼着中间那层学会用尽量少的维度概括数据。这个中间层就是嵌入。本篇讲清自编码器的结构、它与 PCA 的深刻联系、变分自编码器的延伸，以及它独有的可外推优势与训练代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自编码器是一个被刻意&quot;掐细腰&quot;的网络：编码器把高维输入压进低维瓶颈，解码器再从瓶颈重建输入，训练目标就是让重建尽量像原图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高维输入 x] --&gt; B[编码器&lt;br/&gt;多层非线性变换]&#10;  B --&gt; C[瓶颈层 z&lt;br/&gt;低维嵌入]&#10;  C --&gt; D[解码器&lt;br/&gt;多层非线性变换]&#10;  D --&gt; E[重建 x_hat]&#10;  E --&gt; F[重建损失&lt;br/&gt;x 与 x_hat 的差异]&#10;  F --&gt; G[反向传播&lt;br/&gt;更新编码器与解码器]&#10;  G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[高维输入 x] --&gt; B[编码器&lt;br/&gt;多层非线性变换]\n  B --&gt; C[瓶颈层 z&lt;br/&gt;低维嵌入]\n  C --&gt; D[解码器&lt;br/&gt;多层非线性变换]\n  D --&gt; E[重建 x_hat]\n  E --&gt; F[重建损失&lt;br/&gt;x 与 x_hat 的差异]\n  F --&gt; G[反向传播&lt;br/&gt;更新编码器与解码器]\n  G --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>降维中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\mapsto z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.522em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>降维映射本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瓶颈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低维表示</td>\n<td>最终要的嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>↦</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\mapsto \\hat{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.522em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>训练时的&quot;陪练&quot;，推理时可丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重建损失</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert x - \\hat{x}\\rVert^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>逼瓶颈保住信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用重建逼出表示\">用重建逼出表示</h2><p>自编码器的训练目标只有一句话：让输出尽量复现输入。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{f, g} \\; \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\lVert x_i - g(f(x_i)) \\rVert^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于瓶颈层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 的维度远小于输入。网络若想让重建误差小，就必须把信息有效地压进这个窄通道——这逼着编码器学出数据最本质的低维结构。训练完成后，解码器可以丢掉，只留编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 作为降维函数。整个过程无监督，只用数据自身当标签，所以它属于&quot;自监督&quot;的早期形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-pca-的深刻联系\">与 PCA 的深刻联系</h2><p>自编码器和 <a href=\"../linear-methods/pca\">PCA</a> 不是两个孤立的东西，而是连续谱的两端。可以证明：一个编码器、解码器都只有一层线性变换、用均方误差训练的自编码器，学到的瓶颈子空间张成的正是 PCA 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个主成分（解张成同一子空间，方向不必正交对齐）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>线性自编码器</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>MSE</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>PCA 的子空间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{线性自编码器} + \\text{MSE} \\;\\equiv\\; \\text{PCA 的子空间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">线性自编码器</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MSE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PCA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的子空间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>差别从加上非线性激活函数那一刻开始。一旦编码器、解码器变成多层带激活的网络，自编码器就能学出弯曲的非线性映射——它能展开 PCA 压不平的流形，这正是它落在 <a href=\"../foundations/linear-vs-nonlinear\">线性与非线性降维</a> 里&quot;非线性&quot;一格的原因。所以理解自编码器最好的起点，就是把它看成&quot;装上了非线性肌肉的 PCA&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"独有优势-可外推与可定制\">独有优势：可外推与可定制</h2><p>自编码器有一个 t-SNE、UMAP 都给不全的能力：编码器是一个真实的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，训练完直接对任意新样本求值即可得到嵌入，天然支持外推，无需像标准 t-SNE 那样重跑。这让它适合需要持续给新数据降维的生产系统。</p>\n<p>它还高度可定制，这是邻域类方法做不到的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>去噪自编码器</strong>：训练时给输入加噪、要求重建干净版，学到的表示对扰动更鲁棒。</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏自编码器</strong>：对瓶颈层加稀疏约束，逼出更可解释的激活。</li>\n<li><strong>卷积自编码器</strong>：编码器用卷积层，专门处理图像，嵌入保留空间结构。</li>\n<li><strong>序列自编码器</strong>：用循环或注意力结构处理变长序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换句话说，自编码器不是一个固定算法，而是一套可以按数据类型裁剪的框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变分自编码器-从压缩到生成\">变分自编码器：从压缩到生成</h2><p>把瓶颈从&quot;一个点&quot;改成&quot;一个概率分布&quot;，自编码器就升级成变分自编码器（VAE）。编码器不再输出单个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，而是输出一个高斯分布的均值与方差；解码器从这个分布采样来重建。训练目标在重建损失之外加一项 KL 正则，把潜分布拉向标准正态：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>重建</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>正则</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = \\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}[\\lVert x - \\hat{x}\\rVert^2]}_{\\text{重建}} + \\beta \\cdot \\underbrace{\\mathrm{KL}(q(z|x)\\,\\Vert\\,\\mathcal{N}(0, I))}_{\\text{正则}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4404em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">重建</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">正则</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一改让潜空间变得连续而规整：相邻的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 解码出相似的样本，于是你可以在潜空间里采样、插值来<strong>生成</strong>全新数据。VAE 因此横跨降维与生成两个领域，是从&quot;压缩表示&quot;到&quot;生成式表征&quot;的关键一跃。它本身是一个大话题，这里只点到为止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价与取舍\">代价与取舍</h2><p>自编码器的表达力不是免费的。下表把它和邻域类方法的取舍摆清。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自编码器</th>\n<th>t-SNE / UMAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可外推</td>\n<td>是（编码器即函数）</td>\n<td>t-SNE 否、UMAP 部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练成本</td>\n<td>高（要调网络、需较多数据）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小数据表现</td>\n<td>易过拟合</td>\n<td>较稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化即开即用</td>\n<td>否（需设计训练）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示可复用于下游</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：若你只想快速把数据画成二维看一眼，UMAP 或 t-SNE 更省事；若你有较多数据、需要一个可复用、可外推、能嵌进更大模型的非线性表示，自编码器更值。这两条路线如何在真实流水线里取舍、如何防止过拟合，见 <a href=\"../practice/pipelines-pitfalls\">流水线与常见陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自编码器用&quot;压缩-重建&quot;逼瓶颈层学出低维嵌入，无监督、自监督形态。</li>\n<li>线性单层自编码器等价于 PCA 的子空间；非线性激活让它能展开弯曲流形。</li>\n<li>独有优势：编码器是真实函数，<strong>天然可外推</strong>；且可按数据类型定制（去噪/稀疏/卷积/序列）。</li>\n<li>变分自编码器把瓶颈改成分布 + KL 正则，潜空间连续可采样，跨入生成领域。</li>\n<li>代价是训练成本高、小数据易过拟合、不能即开即用做可视化。</li>\n<li>选型：快速看一眼用 UMAP/t-SNE，要可复用可外推的表示用自编码器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自编码器嵌入","id":"自编码器嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用重建逼出表示","id":"用重建逼出表示"},{"level":2,"text":"与 PCA 的深刻联系","id":"与-pca-的深刻联系"},{"level":2,"text":"独有优势：可外推与可定制","id":"独有优势-可外推与可定制"},{"level":2,"text":"变分自编码器：从压缩到生成","id":"变分自编码器-从压缩到生成"},{"level":2,"text":"代价与取舍","id":"代价与取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UMAP 均匀流形近似与投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/manifold-learning/umap"},"next":{"title":"选择目标维数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/choosing-components"}}